==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge]] spawns.
*1 [[Doge]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

